@startuml builder-sequencia-v1
title Builder aplicado a StreamConfig — diagrama de sequência (preset pelo Director)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor<<Client>> #F5F5F5
  BackgroundColor<<Director>> #E1D5E7
  BackgroundColor<<ConcreteBuilder>> #FFE6CC
  BackgroundColor<<Product>> #DAE8FC
  BackgroundColor<<Error>> #F8CECC
}
autonumber

participant "Client\n(demo.ts)" as client <<Client>>
participant ":StreamConfigDirector" as director <<Director>>
participant "builder:\nDefaultStreamConfigBuilder" as builder <<ConcreteBuilder>>
participant "config:\nStreamConfig" as config <<Product>>
participant ":InvalidStreamConfigError" as error <<Error>>

note over client
  Papel de quem chama
  LiveStreamService.createStream(userId, config)
  na Entrega 02.
end note

client -> builder ** : new DefaultStreamConfigBuilder()
client -> director ** : new StreamConfigDirector(builder)

client -> director : highQuality(title)
activate director

director -> builder : reset()
activate builder
note right of builder
  D6: o builder é reaproveitado entre presets
  e build() não limpa o estado; sem reset(),
  um campo do uso anterior vazaria.
end note
builder --> director : builder
director -> builder : withTitle(title)
builder --> director : builder
director -> builder : withLatencyMode(STANDARD)
builder --> director : builder
director -> builder : withVideo(R2160P, 60, 20_000_000)
note right of builder
  R2 garantida pelo tipo:
  resolução, fps e bitrate
  entram num único passo.
end note
builder --> director : builder

director -> builder : build()
builder -> builder : validate()\nR1, R3, R4, R5
note right of builder
  D4/D5: toda a validação acontece aqui,
  acumulando todas as violações.
end note

alt nenhuma violação
  builder -> config ** : StreamConfig.fromBuilder(fields)
  config -> config : Object.freeze(this)
  builder --> director : config
  deactivate builder
  director --> client : config
else alguma regra violada (ex.: título vazio → R1)
  activate builder
  builder -> error ** : new InvalidStreamConfigError(violations)
  builder --> director : throw error
  deactivate builder
  director --> client : throw error\n(o Director não captura nem valida)
end

deactivate director

note over client, director
  lowLatency(title) e mobile(title) seguem a mesma sequência;
  só mudam os argumentos de withLatencyMode e withVideo.
end note
@enduml
